Phonon-2 add-on for Subtitld
Copyright 2026 Subtitld contributors

This add-on is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It runs the Phonon engine and the Phonon-2 model from Fermion Research. It does
not ship the model weights. They are downloaded from Hugging Face on first use,
and the download is checked against a sha256 pinned in the fermion-research
package.

